{"strongs": "H5289", "word": "נַ֫עַר", "translit": "na.ar", "root": "נער", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "boy, lad, youth", "definition": "II. נַ֫עַר 239 noun masculine 1. boy, lad, youth . 2. retainer (not in P ) (Late Hebrew as Biblical Hebrew; Phoenician נער Lzb 324 ); — ׳ נ absolute Gen 37:2 +; construct 1Sam 2:13 +; suffix נַעֲרוֺ Judg 19:3 +, נַעֲרָהּ 2Kgs 4:24 plural נְעָרִים 1Sam 25:5 +, construct נַעֲרֵי Exod 24:5 +; suffix נְעָרַי Neh 4:10 ; Neh 5:10 , etc.; — 1. boy, lad, youth (c. 133 t.) \\ \\ a. of infant Exod 2:6 ( E ; 3 months old), to be born Judg 13:5 ; Judg 13:7 ; Judg 13:8 ; Judg 13:12 , just born 1Sam 4:21 , not weaned 1Sam 1:22 also Isa 8:4 , compare Isa 7:16 +. \\ \\ b. of lad just weaned 1Sam 1:24 (strike out 2nd נער , compare further Dr Bu HPS ), v 1Sam 1:25 v 1Sam 1:27 , etc. \\ \\ c. = youth: of young Ishmael Gen 21:12 f. ( E ), Isaac Gen 22:5 ; Gen 22:12 ( E ), Joseph Gen 37:2 ( E ; 17 years old), Benjamin Gen 43:8 ; Gen 44:22 f. ( J ), sons of Samuel 1Sam 2:17 , of Jesse 1Sam 16:11 קָטֹן ׳ נ little lad 1Sam 20:35 ; 1Kgs 3:7 ; 2Kgs 5:14 ; Isa 11:6 , קָטָן ׳ נ 1Kgs 11:17 , plural 2Kgs 2:23 . \\ \\ d. ׳ נ with special stress on youthfulness Judg 8:20 ; 1Sam 17:33 ; 1Sam 17:42 ; Hos 11:1 ; Isa 3:4 compare Eccl 10:16 ; Isa 3:5 ; Isa 10:19 ; Jer 1:6 ; Jer 1:7 ; 1Chr 22:5 ; 1Chr 29:1 ; 2Chr 13:7 ; 2Chr 34:3 so in phrase וְעַד זָקֵן ׳ מִנּ Gen 19:4 ( J ), Josh 6:21 ( J ), Esth 3:13 compare Exod 10:9 ( E ), Deut 28:50 ; Isa 20:4 ; Isa 65:20 ; Jer 51:22 ; Lam 2:21 ; Ps 37:25 ; Ps 148:12 ; Prov 22:6 . \\ \\ e. of marriageable age Gen 34:19 ( J ), warrior Absalom 2Sam 18:5 ; 2Sam 18:12 +, Zadok 1Chr 12:28 , etc. 2. servant, retainer (c. 105 t): \\ \\ a. = personal attendant, household servant, Num 22:22 ( J ), Judg 7:10 ; Judg 7:11 ; Judg 19:3 ; 1Sam 9:3 f.; 2Kgs 4:12 ; 2Kgs 4:25 + often \\ \\ b. = retainer, follower Gen 14:24 ; 1Sam 25:5 f.; 2Sam 2:14 f.; 1Kgs 20:14 f.; 2Kgs 19:6 = Isa 37:6 ; Job 1:15 ; Job 1:16 ; Job 1:17 ; Neh 4:10 ; Neh 4:17 + often — Zech 11:16 is corrupt, compare We Now . — Note. נער occurs in Pentateuch as Kt with Qr perpet. נַעֲרָה q. v.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5277')\">BDB5277</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5289')\">H5289</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5276')\">BDB5276</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5278')\">BDB5278</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>נַ֫עַר</bdbheb><sub>239</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlightword>boy, lad, youth</highlightword>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlightword>retainer</highlightword> (not in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) (Late Hebrew as Biblical Hebrew; Phoenician <bdbheb>נער</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>324</sup></lookup>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Gen 37:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,2)\">Gen 37:2</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,13)\">1Sam 2:13</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>נַעֲרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 19:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,3)\">Judg 19:3</ref> +, <bdbheb>נַעֲרָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,24)\">2Kgs 4:24</ref> plural <bdbheb>נְעָרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,5)\">1Sam 25:5</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>נַעֲרֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 24:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,5)\">Exod 24:5</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>נְעָרַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,10)\">Neh 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 5:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,10)\">Neh 5:10</ref>, etc.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>boy, lad, youth</highlight> (c. 133 t.) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of infant <ref ref=\"Exod 2:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,6)\">Exod 2:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; 3 months old), to be born <ref ref=\"Judg 13:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,5)\">Judg 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,7)\">Judg 13:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,8)\">Judg 13:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,12)\">Judg 13:12</ref>, just born <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,21)\">1Sam 4:21</ref>, not weaned <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,22)\">1Sam 1:22</ref> also <ref ref=\"Isa 8:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,4)\">Isa 8:4</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 7:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,16)\">Isa 7:16</ref> +. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of lad just weaned <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,24)\">1Sam 1:24</ref> (strike out 2nd <bdbheb>נער</bdbheb>, compare further <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>), v<ref ref=\"1Sam 1:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,25)\">1Sam 1:25</ref> v<ref ref=\"1Sam 1:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,27)\">1Sam 1:27</ref>, etc. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> = youth: of young Ishmael <ref ref=\"Gen 21:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,12)\">Gen 21:12</ref>f. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), Isaac <ref ref=\"Gen 22:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,5)\">Gen 22:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 22:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,12)\">Gen 22:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), Joseph <ref ref=\"Gen 37:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,2)\">Gen 37:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; 17 years old), Benjamin <ref ref=\"Gen 43:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,8)\">Gen 43:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 44:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,22)\">Gen 44:22</ref> f. (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), sons of Samuel <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,17)\">1Sam 2:17</ref>, of Jesse <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,11)\">1Sam 16:11</ref> <bdbheb>קָטֹן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <highlight>little lad</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:35\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,35)\">1Sam 20:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,7)\">1Kgs 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,14)\">2Kgs 5:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 11:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,6)\">Isa 11:6</ref>, <bdbheb>קָטָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb>